  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven or heavy pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and ginger and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add red pepper flakes, ferment-jang, and berbere spice; cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add gobo-burdock and cook, stirring occasionally, for 5 minutes.",
    "Add tomato paste and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add vegetable broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes, or until gobo-burdock is tender.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs, if desired."
